  "title": "Traditional Italian Limoncello",
  "description": "The zest of 10 lemons is steeped in 190-proof alcohol for 1 week then mixed with simple syrup to make this traditional Italian limoncello.",
  "authors": [
    "Maria"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:22:50-04:00",
